    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Observe how a vague prompt results in a plain web page.\r\n- Observe how a detailed prompt creates the pictured web page.\r\n- Locate the controls for adding specific details to the prompt.\r\n- Flip the switches to see how the sample bake sale site changes.\r\n- Note how more detail in the prompt affects the site's look.",
